<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Two
digital currency wallets under the custody of BitGo with fair value of $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--CryptoAssetCost_iI_c20251231__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--SeriesNoteAMember_zAm1GFE9ftWh" title="Crypto asset collateral"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetCost" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_SeriesNoteAMember" id="Fact000886" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">3,836,078</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--CryptoAssetCost_iI_c20251231__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--SeriesNoteBMember_zYpJTRQSht7e" title="Crypto asset collateral"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetCost" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_SeriesNoteBMember" id="Fact000888" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">45,314,805</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, as of December 31, 2025,
were held as collateral for the Series A and Series C convertible notes issued, which totalled $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--CryptoAssetCost_iI_c20251231__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--SeriesNoteAandCMember_zHlzjQgCoDRf" title="Crypto asset collateral"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetCost" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_custom_SeriesNoteAandCMember" id="Fact000890" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">49,150,833</ix:nonFraction></span>.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

