the six-month periods ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, the depreciation expenses recognized were $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--Depreciation_pp0p0_c20250701__20251231_zqEaqTRlu30g" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2025-07-01to2025-12-31" id="Fact001008" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">2,530</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--Depreciation_pp0p0_c20240701__20241231_zqR5PRf07nH3" title="Depreciation expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:Depreciation" contextRef="From2024-07-012024-12-31" id="Fact001010" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD">5,195</ix:nonFraction></span> respectively.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

